{"kind": "candidate", "round": 1, "trial": 4, "parent_sha256": "8d379595598b25478ccad373d39f78738654f82f262b7962fefdb01dbd1a9801", "proof": "theorem InitsUpdatesComm\n  {P : PureExpr} {σ σ' σ'' : SemanticStore P}\n  {ks ks' : List P.Ident} {vs vs' : List P.Expr} :\n  UpdateStates σ ks vs σ' →\n  InitStates σ' ks' vs' σ'' →\n  ∃ σ₁,\n    σ₁ = (updatedStates σ ks' vs') ∧\n    InitStates σ ks' vs' σ₁ ∧\n    UpdateStates σ₁ ks vs σ'' := by\n  intros Hup Hinit\n  refine ⟨updatedStates σ ks' vs', rfl, ?_⟩\n  have Hk : isDefined σ' ks := UpdateStatesDefined Hup\n  have Hlen1 := InitStatesLength Hinit\n  have Hlen2 := UpdateStatesLength Hup\n  induction Hup generalizing σ''\n  case update_none =>\n    simp_all\n    refine ⟨updatedStatesInit Hlen1 (InitStatesNotDefined Hinit) (InitStatesNodup Hinit), ?_⟩\n    simp [InitStatesUpdated Hinit]\n    exact UpdateStates.update_none\n  case update_some σ x v σ₀ xs vs σ₁ Hup Hups ih =>\n    refine ⟨?_, ?_⟩\n    · apply updatedStatesInit Hlen1\n      apply UpdateStateNotDefMonotone' ?_ Hup\n      apply UpdateStatesNotDefMonotone' ?_ Hups\n      exact InitStatesNotDefined Hinit\n      exact InitStatesNodup Hinit\n    · apply UpdateStates.update_some (σ':=updatedStates σ₀ ks' vs')\n      · simp [UpdateStateUpdated Hup, updatedStates]\n        rw [← updatedStateComm']\n        · have Hdef := UpdateStateDefined' Hup\n          simp [isDefined, Option.isSome] at Hdef\n          split at Hdef <;> simp_all\n          next val heq =>\n          apply updatedStateUpdate (v':=val)\n          apply InitStatesSomeMonotone heq\n          apply updatedStatesInit\n          · omega\n          · apply UpdateStateNotDefMonotone' ?_ Hup\n            apply UpdateStatesNotDefMonotone' ?_ Hups\n            apply InitStatesNotDefined Hinit\n          · exact InitStatesNodup Hinit\n        · rw [List.unzip_zip] <;> simp_all\n          have Hnd := InitStatesNotDefined Hinit\n          simp only [ List.mem_cons] at *\n          apply Not.intro\n          intro Hin\n          specialize Hnd _ Hin\n          simp_all\n      · apply ((ih Hinit ?_ ?_).2)\n        · exact UpdateStatesDefined Hups <;> simp_all\n        · exact UpdateStatesLength Hups", "edits": [{"start": 1751, "end": 1777, "replacement": "[ List.mem_cons]", "reason": "simp_list_remove:0:1"}], "evaluation": {"status": "failed", "scores": {"length_reduction_pct": 0.0, "heartbeat_reduction_pct": 0.0, "compatibility_pct": 0.0, "combined_pct": 0.0}, "candidate": {"length": 227, "code_sha256": "13ce026ec64188d1c5c69d51d350465555e5f851506d76e9314e37a6f7222539"}, "primary_version": "v4.29.1", "per_version": {"v4.29.1": {"status": "failed", "passed": false, "heartbeats": null, "heartbeat_reduction_pct": null, "cached": false, "environment_fingerprint": "f335a0dac1b1d96e507ba2b426dca0f3b0a251550d19df160d2aeb228252ddcf", "elapsed_seconds": 2.1991517785936594, "diagnostics": [{"caption": "", "data": "simp_all made no progress", "endPos": {"column": 18, "line": 1021}, "fileName": "_ProofEval_0f973e58e59f497ab6419795e9ab1021.lean", "isSilent": false, "keepFullRange": false, "kind": "[anonymous]", "pos": {"column": 10, "line": 1021}, "severity": "error"}, {"caption": "", "data": "Target declaration depends on sorryAx", "endPos": {"column": 39, "line": 1024}, "fileName": "_ProofEval_0f973e58e59f497ab6419795e9ab1021.lean", "isSilent": false, "keepFullRange": false, "kind": "[anonymous]", "pos": {"column": 0, "line": 972}, "severity": "error"}, {"severity": "error", "message": "Expected exactly one verified target heartbeat marker"}]}}}, "primary_upper_bound": 33.333333333333336, "all_versions_requested": false, "improves_incumbent": false}
